ouse does not chase the mouse\"* is **false**. No contradictions arise from this conclusion, as all other premises align without conflict.\n\n4. **Additional Check**: The bear is also nice and cold, so it must chase the mouse. However, this does not affect the conclusion about the mouse chasing itself.\n\nThus, the correct answer is **B) False**.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
